# Custom site list; copy to ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/universal-search/sites.conf
# Format: site|id|Display name|alias|URL prefix|Group
site|stackoverflow|Stack Overflow|so|https://stackoverflow.com/search?q=|Developer
site|aur|Arch User Repository|aur|https://aur.archlinux.org/packages?K=|Developer

# Legacy four-column format is also accepted:
# example|Example Search|ex|https://example.org/search?q=
